# Project

The whole repository is in English: code, comments, tests, and notes.

Do not add game archives, the executable, saves, screenshots, cover art, or the logo. Do not paste a spoken line, a script body, or a complete game configuration into notes. `docs/LEGAL.md` is the boundary. Menu captions, verb labels, slot labels, the three refusal captions, and the numeric tables live in the modules that use them.

A test runs only on bytes built in the test. Use a short invented label.

A comment points only at a file in this repository.
